If it was me, I'd go down a bit and see if there was a graveyard with
wraiths that could take me to level 17. Cavorting with incubi seems to
work too, but it might have side-effects and *I* haven't had much luck
with that. To make wraiths on a graveyard level ("The hair on the back of
your neck stands up" and similar messages) more likely to leave a corpse,
take them upstairs or downstairs off the level, and let your pet kill
them.

